        "original_id": "c0782d10-6f19-5c1c-8cc8-27488764d795",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Adam Wingard, Simon Barrett, Dan Stevens, Sharni Vinson, Nicholas Tucci, Wendy Glenn, A. J. Bowen, Joe Swanberg\n- Films: The Guest, You're Next, Beauty and the Beast\n- Roles: David, Sir Lancelot, The Beast/Prince\n\nFacts:\n- In 2011, \"You're Next\" was released as an American slasher film directed by Adam Wingard and written by Simon Barrett.\n- In 2011, \"You're Next\" starred Sharni Vinson, Nicholas Tucci, Wendy Glenn, A. J. Bowen, and Joe Swanberg.\n- Adam Wingard and Simon Barrett collaborated on \"You're Next\" before working together on \"The Guest\".\n- In 2014, \"The Guest\" was released as an American action horror-thriller film directed and edited by Adam Wingard and written by Simon Barrett.\n- Dan Stevens starred as David in the thriller film \"The Guest\".\n- Dan Stevens also played The Beast/Prince in Walt Disney's live-action adaptation of \"Beauty and the Beast\".\n- Dan Stevens also played Sir Lancelot in an unspecified work.",
